# Docs

- Plain, direct English. Short sentences. No filler.
- **Each fact lives in one place.** Link to it instead of repeating it.
- Docs describe decisions and their reasons, not code (no function names or file-by-file descriptions in specs).
- Every doc starts with a contents list and ends with a "🤖 How I used AI for this document" section, then Previous / Next links.
- When a new doc is added, update `docs/00-steps.md` in the same change: link the step and remove its ⏳.
- Don't change a documented decision without saying so explicitly.
